<<<
COMMENT: >>>
HER rate is higher than the 298 K reference at the same current.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-CHG-HER
STATUS: Active
